x295 text "A0: `fn NAME T... -> T`, lines `ID OP ARG...`, `ret ARG` (or `ret OP ARGS`), `end`. Types u32 bool io, arrays u32x4, records (u32,bool). Params p0 p1... Args: earlier ID, pN, u32 literal, true, false. `use \"file.a0\"` at top links a file. No forward refs or recursion; ops exact mod 2^32.\n"
