x807 write x806 2
x808 text "Bounds and safety"
x809 puts x807 x808
x810 call close x809 
x811 call open x810 2
x812 write x811 2
x813 text "Static caps: 65536 functions per program (also after linking), 4096 instructions per function, 64 parameters, arrays up to 65536 elements (1024 on the hardware and GPU targets), literal iteration budget 2^24 per function. Variable iteration counts are bounded by fuel in the reference interpreter; compiled targets have no execution budget. io output is bounded by the caller's buffer. There is no heap, no recursion, no exceptions, and no undefined behavior: div and rem by zero are defined, shifts mask the count, indices wrap modulo the array length."
